Protocol primitives adapted from ha-leapmotor-cn, poller/api_client.py (v0.2.4), under GNU AGPLv3.
The Mate CN adapter supplies transport, persistence, routing, permissions and telemetry normalization.
B01 wire shapes and capability semantics also reference leapmotor-app2api/docs/protocol.md and docs/abilities.md.
No credentials, captured sessions, HAR files or APKs are included.

